   "widgets_values": [
    "## Models (put them in ComfyUI/models/...)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n- [ming_image_0.1_design_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ming_image_0.1_design_int8_convrot.safetensors) (Design: text-to-design + editing)\n- [ming_image_0.1_design_layer_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ming_image_0.1_design_layer_int8_convrot.safetensors) (Design-Layer: image → RGBA layers)\n- bf16 versions also exist in the same repo for GPUs with more VRAM\n\n**text_encoders**\n- [ming_image_0.1_ling_mini_2.0_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/ming_image_0.1_ling_mini_2.0_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n- [ming_image_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image/resolve/main/vae/ming_image_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\nRepo: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ming-Image\n"
