   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "### Layer plan (optional)\nOne line per layer, **front-most first**, background **last**.\nThe line count becomes the layer count.\n\nRules from the Ming authors:\n- text goes in front layers, quoted verbatim\n- a card / badge behind text is its **own** layer\n- the main subject is its own layer\n- the background absorbs floors, shadows, patterns\n\nLeave it empty to just use `num_layers`.\n\nAfter the run, open the **Layer Studio**: click the canvas to pick a layer, alt-click to hide it, drag rows to reorder, double-click names to rename, then **Export PSD**. Re-queue to push your choices to the outputs and to *Save PSD*."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#2a2318"
  },
